      "size": 7.800000190734863
    },
    {
      "text": "Heatwaves are deadly.",
      "x": 10.0,
      "top": 92.11943817138672,
      "width": 95.32095336914062,
      "size": 9.0
    },
    {
      "text": "Counterexample: risk without expressed fear",
